{"id":"f842e93646df57eb","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-order11-galois-connection.md","title":"ZFC Order11 Galois Connection","display":"df-zfc-order11-galois-connection — ZFC Order11 Galois Connection","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order11-galois-connection","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order11-galois-connection","58-df-zfc-order9-galois-connection"],"display":"df-zfc-order11-galois-connection — ZFC Order11 Galois Connection","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order11-galois-connection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order11-galois-connection</span><span>58-df-zfc-order9-galois-connection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order11-galois-connection — ZFC Order11 Galois Connection"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g,P,Q,\\leq_P,\\leq_Q\\in V\">\\(f,g,P,Q,\\leq_P,\\leq_Q\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11GaloisConnection}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9GaloisConnection}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11GaloisConnection}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9GaloisConnection}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}galois\\text{-}connection} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11GaloisConnection}_S(f,g,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,P,Q)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,Q,P)\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle f(p),q\\rangle\\in\\leq_Q\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle p,g(q)\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}galois\\text{-}connection} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11GaloisConnection}_S(f,g,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,P,Q)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,Q,P)\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle f(p),q\\rangle\\in\\leq_Q\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle p,g(q)\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}galois\\text{-}connection\\text{-}alias} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9GaloisConnection}_S(f,g,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11GaloisConnection}_S(f,g,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}galois\\text{-}connection\\text{-}alias} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9GaloisConnection}_S(f,g,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11GaloisConnection}_S(f,g,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The adjunction law is stated through membership in the two declared order relations, rather than through unbound infix order notation.</li>\n<li>The order9 Galois-connection variant is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ and $\\mathrm{Function}$ are as in [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]] and [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ and $\\mathrm{Function}$ are as in [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]] and [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,g,P,Q,\\leq_P,\\leq_Q\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11GaloisConnection}_